# The gate guard: the dialogue feature's checks play this file.
~ start
Guard: Halt! Who goes there? [ID:guard_halt]
set visits += 1
Guard: You have {{gold}} gold.
if visits > 1
	Guard: Back again?
elif has_cake
	Guard: Is that cake?
else
	Guard: First time here?
- Pay ten gold [if gold >= 10] => paid
- Offer the cake [if has_cake]
	Guard: I love cake.
- Ask about the castle
	Guard: It's old.
	do castle_asked
	=> shrug
- Walk away => END

~ paid
set gold -= 10
do open_gate
Guard: The gate is open.

~ shrug
The guard shrugs\: nothing more to say.
=> END
